{"title": "Medium Armour Master", "pageid": 8384, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Medium_Armour_Master", "categories": ["Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Medium_Armour_Master.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/da/Medium_Armour_Master.webp/300px-Medium_Armour_Master.webp, /w/images/d/da/Medium_Armour_Master.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/da/Medium_Armour_Master.webp/300px-Medium_Armour_Master.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/da/Medium_Armour_Master.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Medium Armour Master</b> is a passive feature provided by the <a href=\"/wiki/Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feat\">Feat</a> of the same name. Your mastery over Medium Armour increases, granting you increased <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> and the ability to Stealth without <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> from the Medium Armour.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When you wear medium armour, it doesn't impose <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\">Stealth</a> checks. The bonus to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> you can gain from your <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> modifier also becomes +3 instead of +2.\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/38px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Prerequisite Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-prereq\">You must have Proficiency in Medium Armour to take this feat</span> \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the feats:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Armour_Master_(Feat)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Medium Armour Master (Feat)\">Medium Armour Master (Feat)</a>\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The AC bonus increase can also be gained from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Cleric\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Cleric\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp/38px-Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp/50px-Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Initiate: Cleric\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Cleric\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Cleric\">Magic Initiate: Cleric</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>This feat will break the <a href=\"/wiki/Exotic_Material\" title=\"Exotic Material\">Exotic Material</a> feature of certain Medium Armours.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200212\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.042 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.047 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1086/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 8686/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5516/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 24/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.008/7.000 